	(text "VBUS: 4.7 uF at the connector, and a one-way 22 V TVS (ESDA25P35-1U1M, ST's reference part;\ncathode on VBUS). 20 V is the highest PD voltage requested."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "16188039-5135-40b0-998d-75e3d76f8e59")
	)
	(text "USB data ESD: USBLC6-2SC6. Connector side is the _CON nets; the MCU side is USB_D+/USB_D-\n(the 27 ohm series resistors are on the MCU sheet). Keep the pair 90 ohm differential."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 174.752 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "25ce6d88-87b6-4599-8950-94ac686c8cbd")
	)
	(text "CC1 / CC2 ESD: ESDA25W dual TVS (25 V breakdown; the CC pins tolerate up to 22 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "70648a2a-48e4-4e80-9454-ce28bce1ccbc")
	)
	(text "USB-C RECEPTACLE (USB 2.0 data, power and PD). GCT USB4105-GF-A.\nBoth A and B row contacts of VBUS, GND, D+ and D- are tied together so the plug can go in either way.\nSBU1/SBU2 are not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9bf15544-ebba-4232-ba8d-64132711d955")
	)
	(text "STUSB4500 USB PD SINK CONTROLLER (I2C address 0x28). Dead-battery mode: CC1DB/CC2DB tied to CC1/CC2.\nPowered from VBUS (VDD) and +3V3_AUX (VSYS). Default contract set in its NVM (5 V 1.5 A / 15 V 1.5 A /\n20 V 1.0 A); firmware should program the wanted profile once over I2C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ce6d3b90-f056-469b-9344-b715595cc285")
	)
